sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Worker A
    participant R as Redis
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant B as Worker B
    A->>R: SET lock NX PX 2000
    A->>R: INCR fence:S2A-0007
    R-->>A: 7
    Note over A: FROZEN past the TTL
    B->>R: SET lock NX PX 2000
    B->>R: INCR fence:S2A-0007
    R-->>B: 8
    B->>DB: UPSERT ... WHERE fence_token < 8
    DB-->>B: 1 row — accepted
    Note over A: A resumes with token 7
    A->>DB: UPSERT ... WHERE fence_token < 7
    DB-->>A: 0 rows — refused
    Note over A: A learns it lost the lock<br/>from the resource, not from Redis
